    "rich_content": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .edu-index { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 16px 60px; }\n  .edu-intro { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 36px; text-align: center; }\n  .edu-intro h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.2; }\n  .edu-intro p { margin: 0; color: #5b5b5b; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .edu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }\n  @media(min-width: 640px) { .edu-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }\n  .edu-card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 22px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: inherit;\n    transition: box-shadow .2s, border-color .2s;\n  }\n  .edu-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08); border-color: #d1d5db; }\n  .edu-card svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #111; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .edu-card .edu-pill {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: .7rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .06em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    background: #f3f4f6;\n    color: #555;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 3px 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    width: fit-content;\n  }\n  .edu-card h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.3; }\n  .edu-card p { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; font-size: .95rem; flex-grow: 1; }\n  .edu-card .edu-cta {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    font-size: .875rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #111;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  .edu-divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 40px 0 36px; }\n  .edu-footer { text-align: center; }\n  .edu-footer p { color: #5b5b5b; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: .95rem; }\n  .edu-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; }\n  .edu-press { margin: 44px 0 0; text-align: center; }\n  .edu-press-label { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #b0b8b4; margin: 0 0 14px; }\n  .edu-press-items { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 28px; justify-content: center; }\n  .edu-press-items a { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: #888; text-decoration: none; transition: color .15s; }\n  .edu-press-items a:hover { color: #111; }\n  .edu-btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 11px 24px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: .9rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background .15s, border-color .15s;\n  }\n  .edu-btn-primary { background: #111; color: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #111; }\n  .edu-btn-primary:hover { background: #333; border-color: #333; }\n  .edu-btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #111; border: 1.5px solid #111; }\n  .edu-btn-secondary:hover { background: #f3f4f6; }\n</style>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"edu-title\" class=\"edu-index\">\n\n  <div class=\"edu-intro\">\n    <h1 id=\"edu-title\">Night Visibility Education</h1>\n    <p>Research-backed guides on how reflective gear works, why placement matters, and how to share what you know with your running club or team.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edu-grid\">\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/retroreflective-vs-fluorescent\" class=\"edu-card\" aria-label=\"Retroreflective vs. Fluorescent guide\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <circle stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/>\n        <path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"edu-pill\">Science</span>\n      <h2>Retroreflective vs. Fluorescent</h2>\n      <p>Fluorescent gear fails completely after dark. Learn the optical difference and why your hi-vis jacket provides almost no protection at night.</p>\n      <span class=\"edu-cta\">Read the guide &rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/how-fluorescent-fabric-works\" class=\"edu-card\" aria-label=\"How Fluorescent Fabric Works guide\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <circle stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/>\n        <path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"edu-pill\">Science</span>\n      <h2>How Fluorescent Fabric Works</h2>\n      <p>Ever wondered why neon colors look intensely bright during the day? Learn the quantum physics of UV light conversion and their night limitations.</p>\n      <span class=\"edu-cta\">Read the science &rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/biomotion-science\" class=\"edu-card\" aria-label=\"Biomotion Science guide\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5S7 5.24 7 8c0 1.6.75 3.02 1.92 3.95L12 21l3.08-9.05A4.99 4.99 0 0 0 17 8Z\"/>\n        <circle fill=\"currentColor\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"edu-pill\">Science</span>\n      <h2>Biomotion Science</h2>\n      <p>Reflective markers at your ankles and knees help drivers recognize you from 7 times farther away at night than a standard vest. Placement changes everything.</p>\n      <span class=\"edu-cta\">Read the guide &rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/visibility-illusion\" class=\"edu-card\" aria-label=\"The Visibility Illusion research\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7-11-7-11-7Z\"/>\n        <circle stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/>\n        <line stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"1\"/>\n        <line stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"edu-pill\">Research</span>\n      <h2>The Visibility Illusion</h2>\n      <p>Pedestrians consistently overestimate how visible they are at night, often by a wide margin. See the data behind the gap between perception and reality.</p>\n      <span class=\"edu-cta\">Read the research &rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/night-safety-workshop\" class=\"edu-card\" aria-label=\"Night-Safety Workshop guide\">\n      <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <rect stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/>\n        <path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4M7 14h4M7 17h6\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"edu-pill\">Workshop</span>\n      <h2>Night-Safety Workshop</h2>\n      <p>A complete guide for coaches, clubs, and schools. 30-minute agenda, live flashlight demo, and tips for getting people to show up.</p>\n      <span class=\"edu-cta\">Get the workshop guide &rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"edu-divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"edu-footer\">\n    <p>All content is backed by peer-reviewed research published in <em>Human Factors</em>, <em>Accident Analysis &amp; Prevention</em>, and <em>Clinical and Experimental Optometry</em>.</p>\n    <div class=\"edu-btns\">\n      <a href=\"/pages/night-safety-workshop\" class=\"edu-btn edu-btn-secondary\">Run a Workshop</a>\n      <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"edu-btn edu-btn-primary\">Shop Reflective Gear</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edu-press\">\n    <p class=\"edu-press-label\">As seen on</p>\n    <div class=\"edu-press-items\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.runnersworld.com/gear/a38254827/reflective-gear-to-run-safely-in-the-dark/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Runner's World</a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.bicycling.com/bikes-gear/g41029852/best-reflective-gear/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bicycling</a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.irunfar.com/best-reflective-running-gear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iRunFar</a>\n      <a href=\"https://road.cc/content/review/reflectoes-highly-reflective-night-safety-socks-282827\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">road.cc</a>\n      <a href=\"https://fueledbylolz.com/2020/10/28/reflectoes-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FueledByLolz</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n",
